<title>USA: Lexmark names Curlander president of unit.</title>
<headline>Lexmark names Curlander president of unit.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Ky. 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lemark International Inc, a unit of Lexmark International Group Inc, said Monday it named Paul Curlander president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Curlander, previously executive vice president of operations, was also elected to the board of both Lexmark International and the parent company.</p>
</text>
